{"title":"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Easiest_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Easiest Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532f9feec1b0cded4f618f5fda8a75215aa90914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^x} 3^{20} = \\log_{2^{x+3}} 3^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69e55e14b5e2d7def90579e2630e90ceaed4442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log _{2^x}3^{20}=\\log _{2^{x+3}}3^{2020}=n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"19\" />. Based on the equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11d555ff75e7a41103f0d4038b21f4dcf8055aa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^x)^n=3^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/989575caa9583c408a2e220e6a8254d9708664b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{x+3})^n=3^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"19\" />. Expanding the second equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95830f76093355e6ff45dc7618d9b4101e8a70d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^n\\cdot2^{xn}=3^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"17\" />. Substituting the first equation in, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6fe15aa12c1466947f23053445345f6fec3eac75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^n\\cdot3^{20}=3^{2020}$\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02aa11c39a607faca8efb6052f2a1b53c474dc3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^n=3^{2000}$\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />. Taking the 100th root, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/2/99244dd878cfb4dceafa143ef78ce20915192748.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{\\frac{n}{100}}=3^{20}$\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/d/8dd52eab7ad30c44e35703e3f9c392c66446e918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{\\frac{3}{100}})^n=3^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"22\" />, and using the our first equation(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87485bcde5da86ef9d736e0993080f9d08a311c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{xn}=3^{20}$\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />), we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f60b0010dd456589cabc1d0c9626bf78e4f56b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a34a28c5c9f537869e84e8d8894cb07ffbc64a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{103}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n~rayfish\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Easiest_Solution\">Easiest Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Easiest Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/becccb1afdfb1f090265bd8d0e93766e26d179e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a^n} b^{m} = \\frac{m}{n}\\log_{a} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"153\" height=\"33\" /> (which is easily proven using exponents or change of base).\nThen this problem turns into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0f4da8462f7a0312ee5c7db26e6c8f6a632eb7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{20}{x}\\log_{2} 3 = \\frac{2020}{x+3}\\log_{2} 3\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"39\" />\nDivide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2747feca8ed474ea50fe187eed6658d65f4c0444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2} 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> from both sides. And we are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83b1aec4ae7a00940f07298ac995007536883662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{x}=\\frac{2020}{x+3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"90\" height=\"39\" />.Solving this simple equation we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95353faf33ed7bdbb546325803649ad18766ca2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\tfrac{3}{100} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{103}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"24\" />\n~mlgjeffdoge21\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d21e385185a0ce225b5532d60ce7d5d4232dd75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a{b^c}=c\\log_a{b},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"17\" /> we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37a63d8c7ce74fa2e19d50a79830e620cda840da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\log_{2^x} 3 = 2020\\log_{2^{x+3}} 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae1a9b83ffa74a0d1d9d93021e65be61789570b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^x} 3 = 101\\log_{2^{x+3}} 3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"17\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/b/f4bba6f6820c758cf3f47cb6f908eec57ec74c63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a{b}=\\dfrac{1}{\\log_b{a}},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"117\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb90c0b188d644ec19ea9a741ff783cb78831dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^x} 3=\\dfrac{1}{\\log_{3} 2^x},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"134\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae1580fac6db95ca2373e901b7aeda60eac1af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101\\log_{2^{x+3}} 3=101\\dfrac{1}{\\log_{3}2^{x+3}},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"222\" height=\"41\" /> thus resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2aa0ab7b05f8819044b3f0fe8a8b1c4cc4cf0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}2^{x+3}=101\\log_{3} 2^x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"19\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/790c1290063dee8ee8cd610bdbdea61c6a375bde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}2^{x+3}=\\log_{3} 2^{101x}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"19\" /> We remove the base 3 logarithm and the power of 2 to yield <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/9/46955efb54fdc4b80d16c35f9bc776177aaf3e83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3=101x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/2628219dd65bf24c1f879cd893dc9ca8896bc3bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\dfrac{3}{100}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75b7b39bffbedad38158a896317588ff7abbc225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{3+100=103}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"125\" height=\"24\" />\n~ OreoChocolate\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the Change of Base Formula to convert the logarithms in the given equation to base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f76277486de72dd6750d7b5feeeda3a59e99b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_2 3^{20}}{\\log_2 2^x} = \\frac{\\log_2 3^{2020}}{\\log_2 2^{x+3}}, \\text{~ and then ~} \\frac{20\\log_2 3}{x\\cdot\\log_2 2} = \\frac{2020\\log_2 3}{(x+3)\\log_2 2}.\\]\" width=\"456\" height=\"43\" />Canceling the logarithm factors then yields<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aa754e5c62ce64fda285bd562ccc147748c3d77.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{20}x = \\frac{2020}{x+3},\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />which has solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/e/49ec6e0c9eff4c810e9c209815dc67b86880a2d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac3{100}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> The requested sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5d3f2a9f6cab89483cfd8da6cb707bda62d0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 100 = 103$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f752e7aec5d84485805555f97dd89f6cbeccfd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^x} 3^{20} = 2^{xy} = 3^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da659b0d6b791712469a00fb62a23bf234fae787.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^{x+3}} 3^{2020} = (2^{x+3})^y = 3^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"231\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/0/f90685b92c4ceace77e649099aad40e6771ef7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2020} = (3^{20})^{101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae21c9cc0f5d3bdaf580f10c2bdfd02c30188ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{xy})^{101} = (2^{x+3})^y = 3^{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c015127b7c4e8e20acc9822e5785c3424160ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{xy})^{101} = (2^{x+3})^y \\Rightarrow 2^{101xy} = 2^{xy+3y} \\Rightarrow 101xy = xy + 3y \\Rightarrow 101xy = y(x+3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"609\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/c/fec52ac406524098c0d8942cc761efbbd75a159b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101x = x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab8ac305f8227198e2b76e2bfe7a8a77aa64647d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/9/2c99670831e68646366532d672a87d01e9e3908c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/1/a71f6d91d0ca0299b51092b02c8246dccdc9c1bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 + 3 = \\boxed{103}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" /> ~Airplanes2007\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5b767c0a972247ccc3aa459217a64122b8bff5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Lemma}:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9ef6928c76836000cc6e2493fd91f0ebc9556e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a^c}{b} = \\frac{1}{c} \\log_{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d2445257c181accf0e7cb119bac68135c1292dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Proof of the Lemma}:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Change of base and exponent property of logarithms on LHS gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394465f39475f0325c699cc5724d02f02bf312be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log{b}}{c\\log{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"53\" height=\"43\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffc291f45ea84b8b8c28ec94b8443a40827d7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{c} \\cdot \\frac{\\log{b}}{\\log{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"68\" height=\"43\" /> in which converse of change of base gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8d39a1eda209cabceb67870672db6aba6268f78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{c} \\log_{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"60\" height=\"38\" /> as desired.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95e2ecba627414a64931889a43b15a884e9a72ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{2020 AIME II Q3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Apply the lemma on both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adf3584eb5d7f8612037c15c395bf386f1516d6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} \\cdot \\log_{2}{3^{20}} = \\frac{1}{x+3} \\cdot \\log_{2}{3^{2020}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"240\" height=\"40\" />. Then, apply the exponent property to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c72cd09d87ab1d7982978e77834ad4f1b203a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2}{3^{\\frac{20}{x}}} = \\log_{2}{3^{\\frac{2020}{x+3}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"24\" />. Equivalent logarithms give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de3967309dcfb5a89601e0b463f56230088fc9df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\frac{20}{x}} = 3^{\\frac{2020}{x+3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" /> and equivalent bases give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/a/86a77399a422f8a61298e6655dd612b3df520748.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{x} = \\frac{2020}{x+3}~:~x \\neq -3, 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"195\" height=\"40\" />. Then, the statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2db7afe861fa9f75cba383d47ba843d757c5a14c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60+20x = 2020x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" /> is obtained following that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f6ae55a4f415b0806265138a762517759bdf835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{100} \\implies \\boxed{103}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"156\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZCm0SOjTPVE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZCm0SOjTPVE</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lPr4fYEoXi0\">https://youtu.be/lPr4fYEoXi0</a> ~ CNCM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x0QznvXcwHY?t=528\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x0QznvXcwHY?t=528</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-CkEF5nWOaI\">https://youtu.be/-CkEF5nWOaI</a> \n</p><p>~avn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2TSNY2DDUbQ&amp;t=3s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2TSNY2DDUbQ&amp;t=3s</a> ~ MathEx\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5 by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=1648\">https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=1648</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II\" title=\"2020 AIME II\">2020 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a